@VscmsErp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### Health
GET {{VscmsErp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Demo login (admin)
POST {{VscmsErp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### Current user
GET {{VscmsErp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Students list
GET {{VscmsErp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json
